4. Relation to the rest of the repository
   The PC application "Yume Companion" in the rest of this repository is a modified version of Soul of Waifu and is licensed
   under the GNU GPL v3 (see ../LICENSE and ../NOTICE.md). The Android app is a separate program that talks to it over the
   network. Its 3D avatar page was written from scratch for the app; it does not contain code of Soul of Waifu.
   Versions of this folder that were published before this license was added (the commits and releases up to and including
   v3.0.0-beta11) remain available to those who received them under the license that applied at the time.

